        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.2</title>
            <link>https://github.com/k0nker/ss_chatmix_macOS/releases/tag/v1.0.2</link>
            <sparkle:version>1.0.2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New in v1.0.2</h2>
        <h3>Added</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Real-time ChatMix dial monitoring</li>
            <li>Live volume visualization in Settings window</li>
            <li>Automatic updates via Sparkle</li>
            <li>Native macOS menu bar app</li>
            <li>Settings window with device configuration</li>
            <li>Auto-update toggle in Settings (default: enabled)</li>
            <li>GitHub repository link in About dialog</li>
            <li>Background HID thread prevents UI blocking</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Fixed</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Audio crackling when opening Settings/About dialogs</li>
            <li>Threading architecture to prevent main thread blocking</li>
            <li>UI update throttling (250ms) to reduce audio thread starvation</li>
        </ul>
    ]]>            </description>
